// Mediterranean scrub animals (V2-10 (c)): the maquis and garrigue of the Old World — the
// rabbit and the lynx that lives on it, the red-legged partridge, the tortoise and the snakes —
// and the chaparral of California with its mule deer and quail. The wood's and the steppe's
// boar, deer, foxes, wolves and eagles live in the scrub too.
